rodigious weapons engineer from the technologically advanced city of Eruditio, known for carrying four custom-built firearms each named after fallen comrades. After watching her mentor's workshop burn during a raid by the Abyss, she swore vengeance and crafted her arsenal from the wreckage. Her mechanical genius allows her to switch between sniper, shotgun, submachine gun, and grenade launcher in the heat of battle. Beatrix fights not just for revenge but to ensure no inventor's legacy is ever destroyed again.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow Eruditio weapons specialist\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"fanny\",\"heroName\":\"Fanny\",\"relationship\":\"Eruditio sky trooper who covers her from above\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"johnson\",\"heroName\":\"Johnson\",\"relationship\":\"Eruditio mechanical guardian and ally\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"moskov\",\"heroName\":\"Moskov\",\"relationship\":\"His spear counters her ranged dominance\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"helcurt\",\"heroName\":\"Helcurt\",\"relationship\":\"Shadow creature that destroyed her mentor's lab\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Beatrix\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":49.8,\"pickRate\":0.72,\"banRate\":0.66},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":49.8,\"pickRate\":0.72,\"banRate\":0.65},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":49.25,\"pickRate\":0.72,\"banRate\":0.63},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":51.98,\"pickRate\":0.69,\"banRate\":0.43},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":51.71,\"pickRate\":0.7,\"banRate\":0.42},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":51.22,\"pickRate\":0.69,\"banRate\":0.42},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":51.24,\"pickRate\":0.61,\"banRate\":0.4}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n62:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Beatrix\",\"heroSlug\":\"beatrix\",\"roles\":\"$61:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$61:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":3,\"winRate\":51.24,\"pickRate\":0.61,\"banRate\